                2: '"The same belief tradition can be a gift in one situation and a weapon in another." Using Christianity\'s arrival in Canada as your example — through missionaries, through colonial policy such as residential schools, AND through recent immigrant Christian communities — evaluate this statement. Then explain what the example teaches about judging a tradition by how it spread.',
