                1: '\'A tradition lives or dies by its daily observances, not its festivals or texts.\'\n\nPick ONE daily observance from this unit (grace, Salah, the Shema, the Five Ks, the sunrise ceremony) and ONE festival. In 2–3 sentences, say what each one does for a tradition, and whether you agree with the sentence.',
