                2: 'Reflect on the course (A4.4). Using at least two of the four unit assignments and one of this lesson\'s cases, evaluate your own research, inquiry, and communication skills: which step of the research process you did best, which source question changed how you read, what you would do differently, and what question about belief traditions remains for you. Then connect your remaining question to the idea of sacred place — what would you need to see, visit, or ask to answer it?',
